{
"Items.SilkArmor.Desc": "A set of armor made from spider silk, as white as the driven snow. It's crafted out of thousands of strands of spider-silk into an impenetrable protective suit. The surface is slightly spongy, but so tough you wager most blows would bounce right off."
"Items.SilkArmor.Long": "a suit of spider-silk armor"
"Items.SilkArmor.Short": "S.Silk Armor"
}
